## Validation contract

`LocalStateGateway` validates settings, supplier/category, invoice/line, payment, and daily-income envelopes and their references. ISO calendar dates and UTC timestamps are checked strictly, so impossible values such as `2026-02-30` recover to empty state with `needs_seed`; valid ISO values remain `ready`. No seed/loadSeed/restore, M0.3b adapter, UI, domain type, Supabase, or auth behavior was added.

